<title>USA: CBOE to list seven equity FLEX options on Nov 5.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list seven equity FLEX options on Nov 5.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options (CBOE) will list FLexible EXchange (FLEX) options on seven equities on Tuesday, November 5, the exchange said.</p>
<p>The CBOE will list Equity FLEX options on AT &amp; T Corp, Chrysler Corp, Citicorp, Ford Motor Co, General Electric Co, Merck &amp; Co Inc and Storage Technology Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;Institutional market users, having realized the benefits of trading FLEX Options on broad-based U.S. stock indices, requested that the exchange extend the FLEX Options complex to include equities,&quot; CBOE vice chairman William Floersch, said.</p>
<p>The exchange will introduce 10 equity FLEX Options on Thursday, October 24. -Derivative desk 312-408-8750;E-mail derivatives@reuter.com</p>
